WEBVTT

00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:12.620
All that aside...

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:16.560
I never thought Ai would be the one to save us.

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:22.500
As far as helpers go, she really comes in handy!

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.370
But this is no time to be all smiles.

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.410
True. We have to find the queen.

00:00:28.410 --> 00:00:29.570
You're right.

00:00:30.180 --> 00:00:30.940
Excuse me!

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.680
Wh-What?

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.250
Um, Aida!

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:38.850
Y-Yes?

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:42.890
Please make me your disciple!

00:00:43.420 --> 00:00:44.560
Di...

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:45.820
Disciple?

00:00:48.860 --> 00:00:53.230
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:00:53.230 --> 00:00:55.700
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:58.570
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:00.610
Every day it sparkles

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:04.310
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:05.780 --> 00:01:11.180
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:11.780 --> 00:01:16.860
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:17.020 --> 00:01:22.490
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:23.030 --> 00:01:27.930
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:33.640
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:42.510
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.180
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:44.180 --> 00:01:46.590
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:01:46.820 --> 00:01:49.420
Our happy love will change the world

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:52.220
What's more than just cute

00:01:52.520 --> 00:01:56.090
is our promise between girls

00:01:56.900 --> 00:02:02.130
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:02.170 --> 00:02:08.040
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:12.450 --> 00:02:13.740
So...

00:02:13.740 --> 00:02:16.680
you're Saotome Jun from the first year's class B, right?

00:02:16.680 --> 00:02:19.520
Oh, Yashima, sorry for stealing your seat!

00:02:19.760 --> 00:02:20.810
Don't worry.

00:02:20.810 --> 00:02:22.050
Oh, yes!

00:02:22.050 --> 00:02:26.390
I'm asking because I realized that being your disciple would be a dream come true!

00:02:26.390 --> 00:02:28.370
What's a disciple?

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.480
Disciples follow around someone they respect

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:33.290
and learn as much as they can from them!

00:02:33.290 --> 00:02:34.600
Another one?

00:02:34.600 --> 00:02:35.790
Another what?

00:02:35.790 --> 00:02:38.610
A lot of students respect Mana,

00:02:38.610 --> 00:02:41.660
so stuff like this isn't rare.

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:47.250
So, what made you want to be my disciple?

00:02:47.250 --> 00:02:50.300
Well, it happened yesterday.

00:02:53.190 --> 00:02:54.980
So heavy...

00:02:59.220 --> 00:03:00.150
Are you all right?

00:03:00.150 --> 00:03:01.090
Huh?

00:03:01.440 --> 00:03:02.450
Let me help.

00:03:03.530 --> 00:03:04.730
No, I...

00:03:04.730 --> 00:03:06.640
Where to? The library?

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:07.760
Well, yes...

00:03:07.760 --> 00:03:10.300
Oh, um, sorry!

00:03:10.300 --> 00:03:12.270
Don't sweat it.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:13.770
I'll handle this.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:21.710
You looked so strong and reliable...

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.880
You were like Prince Charming on a white horse! {I don't want to keep the white horse here, but I need it for the next line. It can't be helped.}

00:03:27.690 --> 00:03:29.550
What's the horse for?

00:03:29.810 --> 00:03:34.890
I want to be a tough, strong guy, just like you, Aida!

00:03:34.890 --> 00:03:37.190
Mana's not a guy, either...

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:39.130
I beg you,

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:40.900
please make me your disciple!

00:03:40.900 --> 00:03:41.670
Okay.

00:03:41.670 --> 00:03:42.990
"Okay?"

00:03:43.290 --> 00:03:44.530
Really?

00:03:44.530 --> 00:03:45.560
Sure.

00:03:45.560 --> 00:03:48.490
If I can help you, I will!

00:03:48.490 --> 00:03:49.750
Thank you so much!

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:51.980
Another pain in the neck...

00:03:52.380 --> 00:03:53.840
She couldn't reject him...

00:03:53.840 --> 00:03:55.410
that's so Mana.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:04:00.250
I, Saotome Jun, swear to be the best disciple you've ever seen!

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:07.760
Mana's Determination!

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:07.760
Mana's Determination!

00:04:11.700 --> 00:04:14.080
I can't make heads or tails outta all this ruckus!

00:04:14.080 --> 00:04:15.530
Line up!

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:17.740
I'm too late!

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:20.300
Guess I'm going without my noodle sub today...

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.440
You want a noodle sub?

00:04:22.760 --> 00:04:23.720
Pres!

00:04:23.720 --> 00:04:25.910
I'll just buy two.

00:04:25.910 --> 00:04:27.200
Caf lady!

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:29.100
Got any noodle subs?

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:30.420
Oh, Mana!

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:31.540
Just sit tight!

00:04:31.540 --> 00:04:33.360
I'm kinda short on hands!

00:04:33.360 --> 00:04:34.820
Then let me help!

00:04:34.820 --> 00:04:36.280
Just wait a bit.

00:04:36.280 --> 00:04:38.240
Huh? But what about his...

00:04:38.240 --> 00:04:41.640
Hey, excuse me, pardon me...

00:04:41.640 --> 00:04:43.280
I'll help!

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.280
Excuse me, excuse me!

00:04:46.790 --> 00:04:48.230
You okay?

00:04:49.670 --> 00:04:51.700
Now, what's your order?

00:04:52.190 --> 00:04:53.700
Variety sandwich and orange juice!

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:54.520
I want a croquette sandwich!

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:55.970
I'll have a ham sandwich with strawberry milk! {Strawberry milk is god tier. I like her.}

00:04:55.970 --> 00:04:57.200
Chocolate bread and milk! {The fuck? You can just have chocolate for lunch?}

00:04:57.200 --> 00:04:58.250
Croquette sandwich and juice here!

00:04:58.250 --> 00:04:59.940
Cutlet sandwich and orange juice!

00:04:59.940 --> 00:05:02.240
Here, a variety sandwich and orange juice.

00:05:02.240 --> 00:05:04.950
Croquette sandwich, strawberry milk, and a ham sandwich.

00:05:04.950 --> 00:05:06.270
Chocolate bread and milk,

00:05:06.270 --> 00:05:07.860
Croquette sandwich and apple juice,

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:09.690
Cutlet sandwich and orange juice.

00:05:09.690 --> 00:05:12.620
Your respective changes are 50 yen, 40 yen, and 240 yen.

00:05:13.100 --> 00:05:14.550
Enjoy!

00:05:16.140 --> 00:05:18.070
Aida's really something.

00:05:18.840 --> 00:05:20.550
We're sold out!

00:05:20.550 --> 00:05:21.590
Here.

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:22.880
Sweet!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.280
Thanks, Pres!

00:05:24.970 --> 00:05:26.240
Enjoy!

00:05:26.240 --> 00:05:28.170
You're a lifesaver, Mana.

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:29.880
Don't mention it.

00:05:30.300 --> 00:05:32.720
So, what about <i>your</i> lunch?

00:05:35.690 --> 00:05:37.140
Guess you forgot.

00:05:37.630 --> 00:05:39.340
You're really something.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:42.400
You gave up your own lunch for others!

00:05:42.400 --> 00:05:44.500
Your kindness knows no depths!

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:48.720
Madam Rikka!

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:51.390
Okay, I'll give you part of mine.

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:54.050
What's wrong?

00:05:54.050 --> 00:05:55.070
Aida!

00:05:55.070 --> 00:05:56.340
Are you all right?

00:05:56.340 --> 00:05:57.130
Yes...

00:05:57.130 --> 00:05:59.040
Let's go to the infirmary.

00:05:59.360 --> 00:06:02.080
Now she's helping someone else.

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:03.280
I'll help too!

00:06:04.390 --> 00:06:06.110
Thank you, Pres.

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:08.680
Good thing it wasn't anything serious.

00:06:08.680 --> 00:06:09.800
Doctor!

00:06:09.800 --> 00:06:11.280
Oh, what's wrong?

00:06:11.280 --> 00:06:13.800
Aida, I hate to be a bother,

00:06:13.800 --> 00:06:17.190
but could you take the papers on the desk to the staff room?

00:06:17.190 --> 00:06:17.990
Sure!

00:06:17.990 --> 00:06:18.560
Huh?

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:22.490
You callin' me a punk, punk? {This is more in line with what I have for the v2s}

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:24.600
Punk, you callin' me a punk, punk?

00:06:25.810 --> 00:06:28.160
Now now, settle down!

00:06:29.510 --> 00:06:31.530
They just keep coming...

00:06:32.430 --> 00:06:34.170
I'll help!

