00:06:59.900 --> 00:07:02.870
Solitaire

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.980
I'm back, Ai!

00:07:07.310 --> 00:07:09.680
You take care of a baby, too?

00:07:09.680 --> 00:07:10.690
Yeah.

00:07:10.690 --> 00:07:12.200
Wanna hold her?

00:07:12.200 --> 00:07:12.940
Huh?

00:07:13.680 --> 00:07:15.750
Yes! I'll do what I can!

00:07:16.890 --> 00:07:17.540
Here.

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:22.270
Sh-She's quite heavy...

00:07:27.380 --> 00:07:28.850
Don't do that, Ai!

00:07:28.850 --> 00:07:31.430
Oh no, it's nothing.

00:07:31.740 --> 00:07:33.230
Look, Ai!

00:07:38.600 --> 00:07:39.670
Ai!

00:07:40.650 --> 00:07:42.690
Rikka, I know what to do!

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:43.600
I see!

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.130
Yo! Checka Racka!

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:00.840
You seem tired.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:03.900
No surprise. He's been going at Mana's pace.

00:08:04.220 --> 00:08:07.200
It's best to eat candy when you're tired.

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:08.540
Please, take some.

00:08:08.540 --> 00:08:10.370
Thanks.

00:08:15.470 --> 00:08:17.660
Wh-What is it?

00:08:17.660 --> 00:08:20.320
You're a real fighter, Jun.

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:25.600
Oh no, I'm nothing compared to you.

00:08:25.600 --> 00:08:28.190
But really, today's been pretty busy, huh?

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:29.520
Maybe.

00:08:29.520 --> 00:08:31.040
But it was fun!

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.240
Fun?

00:08:32.240 --> 00:08:32.920
Yeah.

00:08:33.730 --> 00:08:39.500
Doesn't it feel nice to make someone happy and get thanked in return?

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:42.020
Nice...

00:08:42.020 --> 00:08:42.830
Yup.

00:08:44.680 --> 00:08:47.280
<i>I've barely been able to catch my breath,</i>

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:48.930
<i>so I didn't notice... {It's more like he hasn't had the time to stop and smell the roses, but eh.}</i>

00:08:50.020 --> 00:08:53.440
<i>Can I really change myself...</i>

00:08:54.140 --> 00:08:55.510
<i>to be like her?</i>

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:01.250
<i>Yeah, I can, as long as I try!</i>

00:09:03.110 --> 00:09:06.090
I have just the thing for one as resilient as you.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:07.830
So your dreams may come true,

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:10.250
I present you with this Lovies.

00:09:11.080 --> 00:09:14.060
Th-Thank you very much.

00:09:18.720 --> 00:09:21.970
Curse those Precures...

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:24.250
You had to go into Beast Mode?

00:09:24.250 --> 00:09:26.310
My, someone's a hard worker.

00:09:26.310 --> 00:09:28.170
I had no choice.

00:09:28.480 --> 00:09:30.660
And neither do you two.

00:09:31.770 --> 00:09:34.640
Hey, I've just been toyin' with them until now.

00:09:34.640 --> 00:09:35.510
That's right!

00:09:35.510 --> 00:09:37.180
I've been busy, too! {No idea what パック is here, so I'll just leave it out and assume it's not important.}

00:09:37.580 --> 00:09:40.660
King Selfish's wrath is vicious.

00:09:43.700 --> 00:09:47.370
And with that attitude, you'll get more than a slap on the wrist.

00:09:47.910 --> 00:09:49.030
Fine...

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:50.860
This time,

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:53.090
I won't be playing around!

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:04.080
That's cheap.

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:07.050
As long as you hit 'em, who cares?

00:10:07.470 --> 00:10:08.950
<i>Precures...</i>

00:10:08.950 --> 00:10:10.720
<i>I swear I'll crush you!</i>

00:10:26.980 --> 00:10:29.260
Will you you read all of these?

00:10:29.260 --> 00:10:30.350
Yeah.

00:10:30.350 --> 00:10:32.880
They look like they'll help with what we were asked to do,

00:10:33.230 --> 00:10:34.800
so I'll skim them.

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:36.470
You're really something.

00:10:44.610 --> 00:10:47.460
I'll take the higher books.

00:10:47.460 --> 00:10:48.660
Sorry...

00:10:49.260 --> 00:10:50.830
He's hanging in there.

00:10:51.260 --> 00:10:53.560
Well, he's a hard worker.

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:57.470
But he seems kinda down.

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.350
Whoa!

00:11:10.350 --> 00:11:13.190
That serve was just like my next opponent's!

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:14.970
Like that?

00:11:14.970 --> 00:11:16.590
Yes, please!

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:18.660
That's our president.

00:11:19.010 --> 00:11:22.130
I can't serve like that...

00:11:24.140 --> 00:11:26.380
Well, good luck with your match!

00:11:26.380 --> 00:11:27.930
I'll carry that!

00:11:27.930 --> 00:11:29.540
Well...

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:33.950
It's heavy today, so I'll carry it.

00:11:48.250 --> 00:11:49.420
Alice!

00:11:49.420 --> 00:11:51.460
Good afternoon, everyone.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:03.740
Were you helping Mana today?

00:12:03.740 --> 00:12:04.590
Yes.

00:12:04.590 --> 00:12:06.840
Well, good work.

00:12:07.440 --> 00:12:09.480
<i>Good work, huh?</i>

00:12:16.050 --> 00:12:18.490
<i>But I didn't...</i>

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:24.160
My hat!

00:12:24.690 --> 00:12:26.060
I'll get it!

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.160
I'll help!

00:12:34.470 --> 00:12:37.610
<i>I'm too small,</i>

00:12:37.610 --> 00:12:39.540
<i>too slow,</i>

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:41.410
<i>and too weak!</i>

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:51.820
<i>No matter how hard I try,</i>

00:12:51.820 --> 00:12:54.320
<i>I could never be like her.</i>

00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:58.940
<i>I want to be bigger and stronger!</i>

00:12:58.940 --> 00:13:00.530
<i>More than she is!</i>

00:13:03.290 --> 00:13:05.380
<i>But I know I can't...</i>

00:13:07.270 --> 00:13:09.220
Aw, sure you can.

00:13:10.650 --> 00:13:13.310
I will grant your desire.

00:13:18.560 --> 00:13:19.770
Jun!

00:13:20.300 --> 00:13:21.610
It's you!

00:13:21.610 --> 00:13:25.780
Guess I gotta lift a finger every now and then.

00:13:30.190 --> 00:13:32.870
Grant me your darkness!

00:13:48.570 --> 00:13:51.580
Wait. What happened?

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:53.010
That's...

00:13:53.010 --> 00:13:53.660
an elephant.

00:13:53.660 --> 00:13:54.340
Sure is.

00:13:54.340 --> 00:13:55.390
Why, it certainly is!

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:56.640
It's...

00:13:56.640 --> 00:13:57.860
cute.

00:13:59.300 --> 00:14:01.560
What a cute elephant!

00:14:01.560 --> 00:14:03.320
Don't call me cute!

00:14:04.080 --> 00:14:05.530
It's dangerous here, so run!

00:14:05.530 --> 00:14:06.290
Okay!

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:10.490
Charles!

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:14.400
Precure Love Link!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.220
L-O-V-E!

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:16.930
L-O-V-E!

00:14:16.930 --> 00:14:17.610
L-O-V-E!

00:14:17.610 --> 00:14:18.780
L-O-V-E!

00:14:45.290 --> 00:14:46.600
Brimming with love,

00:14:47.230 --> 00:14:48.700
Cure Heart!

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:52.980
The light of wisdom,

00:14:53.780 --> 00:14:55.270
Cure Diamond!

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:59.640
The warmth of the sun,

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:01.540
Cure Rosetta!

00:15:03.270 --> 00:15:05.110
The blade of courage,

00:15:05.110 --> 00:15:06.760
Cure Sword!

00:15:09.820 --> 00:15:12.480
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:15:12.480 --> 00:15:14.220
Dokidoki Precure!

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:18.360
Oh poor elephant who has lost his love,

00:15:18.930 --> 00:15:20.650
I, Cure Heart,

00:15:20.650 --> 00:15:24.190
will make your heart race once more!

00:15:24.190 --> 00:15:27.150
Cut it with that "heart" junk!

00:15:36.780 --> 00:15:37.800
Heart!

00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:40.410
He's strong.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.550
But he's so cute...

00:15:42.550 --> 00:15:44.460
Don't call me cute!

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:48.430
You still wanna go?

00:15:48.430 --> 00:15:51.470
Just so we're clear, I'm not messin' around today.

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:53.460
No kidding!

00:15:53.460 --> 00:15:55.050
I have to save Jun!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:56.820
Save him from what?

00:15:56.820 --> 00:16:00.910
I'm just granting his deepest desire, see?

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:03.830
I want to be strong...

00:16:03.830 --> 00:16:06.380
big, and strong...

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:07.920
You heard him.

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:10.030
This is what he wished for.

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.230
It's not!

00:16:11.230 --> 00:16:14.950
Jun didn't want it to be this way!

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:19.820
But I can never be like you!

00:16:24.170 --> 00:16:26.560
Which Mana were you following around?

00:16:26.560 --> 00:16:29.130
You think you can be like her with strength alone?

00:16:29.130 --> 00:16:31.070
Of course you can't!

00:16:34.280 --> 00:16:37.800
Mana wasn't always perfect!

00:16:37.800 --> 00:16:41.520
But she wanted to help, so she kept trying!

00:16:41.520 --> 00:16:43.230
And she still does!

00:16:48.890 --> 00:16:50.760
It was never about being able or unable.

00:16:50.760 --> 00:16:55.030
Deep in her heart, Mana simply wanted to help others!

00:16:55.380 --> 00:16:58.040
Her heart is what's strong!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:00.600
You're all too kind...

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:07.210
I always slip and fall on my face...

00:17:11.230 --> 00:17:13.240
Just like you, Jun.

00:17:14.810 --> 00:17:16.040
Tough luck!

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:18.280
The kid can't hear a word you say!

00:17:25.280 --> 00:17:26.690
It's over!

00:17:34.860 --> 00:17:36.000
I missed?!

00:17:36.310 --> 00:17:37.410
How?

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:41.410
What?!

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.290
I can't move my leg!

00:17:45.770 --> 00:17:46.790
The psyche!

00:17:46.790 --> 00:17:47.920
I see!

00:17:47.920 --> 00:17:50.180
Jun's heart is fighting back!

00:17:52.020 --> 00:17:54.150
I knew you could do it...

00:17:54.610 --> 00:17:56.720
Even if you can't be like me,

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:58.860
you're amazing in your own way!

00:18:02.410 --> 00:18:05.310
Sit down and shut up!

00:18:07.740 --> 00:18:09.730
<i>Now</i> it's over!

00:18:11.720 --> 00:18:12.580
What?

00:18:13.760 --> 00:18:18.340
Jun, the way you put your all into everything...

00:18:18.340 --> 00:18:20.440
makes my heart race!

00:18:20.440 --> 00:18:21.910
That's why...

00:18:21.910 --> 00:18:24.670
I won't let you have his heart!

00:18:25.720 --> 00:18:27.250
Give Jun...

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:30.780
back!

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.680
Love Heart Arrow!

00:18:43.640 --> 00:18:46.870
Precure Sparkle Sword!

00:18:57.350 --> 00:19:00.210
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:17.780
Precure Diamond Shower!

00:19:31.090 --> 00:19:33.870
Precure Heart Shoot!

00:19:37.580 --> 00:19:42.290
Jun just wanted to be strong, so he worked hard for it!

00:19:42.790 --> 00:19:46.700
There's absolutely nothing selfish about that!

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:04.080
Cure Heart...

00:20:14.100 --> 00:20:16.880
Huh? What was I...

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:19.230
Simply taking a nap.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:25.140
Something wrong?

00:20:26.890 --> 00:20:27.950
No...

00:20:31.390 --> 00:20:33.650
I haven't seen him lately.

00:20:33.650 --> 00:20:35.540
What's Jun been up to?

00:20:40.720 --> 00:20:42.750
They're so pretty!

00:20:42.750 --> 00:20:45.960
But was this flower bed always here?

00:20:45.960 --> 00:20:47.890
Do you like it?

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:51.320
Jun!

00:20:52.650 --> 00:20:55.110
Wait, did you make this?

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:55.870
Yes.

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:58.090
Gardening's a hobby of mine,

00:20:58.090 --> 00:21:01.340
so I planted some flowers I grew.

00:21:01.340 --> 00:21:03.540
These is all yours?

00:21:03.540 --> 00:21:04.280
Yes.

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:06.720
I realized something.

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:10.300
I can't be as strong as the president.

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:11.240
But...

00:21:11.580 --> 00:21:17.360
I thought it'd be nice if my flowers could make others smile.

00:21:18.100 --> 00:21:23.770
I think this is what I wanted all along.

00:21:23.770 --> 00:21:26.150
Oh, I'm sorry!

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:29.010
I was the one who asked to be your disciple,

00:21:29.010 --> 00:21:29.920
but here I am...

00:21:29.920 --> 00:21:32.390
No, it's amazing, Jun!

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:34.180
It's great that you made this!

00:21:34.600 --> 00:21:36.740
I'm in tears!

00:21:36.740 --> 00:21:39.150
Maybe you should take a disciple.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:39.960
Huh?

00:21:40.670 --> 00:21:42.250
Well, uh...

00:21:42.250 --> 00:21:43.620
I dunno...

00:21:45.540 --> 00:21:48.520
<i>I'm glad Jun's smiling.</i>

00:21:53.370 --> 00:21:56.560
So, <i>they're</i> the Precures.

00:21:57.750 --> 00:22:01.170
I think I've found a fun playmate.

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:28.190
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:31.330
We've Finally Found It?!

00:22:28.190 --> 00:22:31.330
We've Finally Found It?!

00:22:31.560 --> 00:22:33.700
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
